%%{ c4: dynamic }%%
graph TB
    Customer[Customer<br/>Person]
    WebApp[Web Application<br/>Software System]
    API[API Server<br/>Software System]
    DB[Database<br/>Software System]
    Customer -->|Submits form| WebApp
    WebApp -->|Forwards request to| API
    API -->|Queries| DB
    DB -.->|Returns results| API
    API -.->|Returns response| WebApp
